egenerate INDEX.md\n    rollups             list past week/month summaries still in draft\n    bind                bind a session to a project (for non-repo folders)\n    launch              HQ: start the Scheduler run of an approved, frozen\n                        plan (plan-json freeze first)\n    watch               wait for the next news of a run (settled session,\n                        block, wait, end), print it and exit; run it in the\n                        background and re-arm it\n    round               question rounds shared with the web UI\n    plan                plan review shared with the web UI\n    workspace           the project's repos (a project is a workspace of\n                        repos)\n    profiles            account profiles: list, doctor, or check one against a\n                        project\n    work                show or set the project's work flag (gates work-only\n                        profiles)\n    requirements-gate   record/check requirements-v1 revalidation\n    plan-json           manage PLAN.json or read the conservative planning-\n                        history projection\n    plan-status         progress of one plan or all plans (read-only unless\n                        --write)\n    knowledge           ingest, query, export or inspect the project knowledge\n                        map\n    planner             invoke the canonical Planner through a selected local\n                        AI profile\n    delegate            run ONE task in a headless agent session and get a\n                        compact checked result\n    review              independently review current changes in a detached\n                        worktree\n    metrics             attempt telemetry per agent/profile/model/effort (null\n                        = not reported)\n    agents              agent catalog: models, ladder, accounts and usage-\n                        limit state; route preview\n    usage               subscription 5